;
; Margins' tag index in MYRA (margins_rules.h MR4): the notes by tag, then
; note, with when the note was last written (its mtime, seconds since
; 1970). tag is the tag's number in the tag table (1.. in the order first
; seen), note the note's number in the Notes folder's listing; listing the
; notes of one tag walks ^ZXMARGINS(tag) in order ($ORDER).
^ZXMARGINS(tag:i4, note:i4) = stamp:i12!
